		'Under NODE_ENV=test with no HAL_HOME, the home falls back to /tmp/hal-test-home-<pid>. It is a safety net, not cleanup: tests that spawn ./run without HAL_HOME leave such dirs behind. Set HAL_HOME to a temp dir you delete.',
